            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Market Risk on in 2024 Economic downturn\" data-id=\"1811512281\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1022\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1811512281/image_1811512281.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1811512281/image_1811512281.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1811512281/image_1811512281.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1811512281/image_1811512281.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1811512281/image_1811512281.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1811512281/image_1811512281.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1811512281/image_1811512281.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1811512281/image_1811512281.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1811512281/image_1811512281.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">primeimages/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <h2>Introduction</h2> <p>Nebius Group N.V. (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NBIS\" title=\"Nebius Group N.V.\">NBIS</a></span>) has had a brutal fall, as shares peaked around $300 late June and now trade around $118, a haircut of <strong>60%</strong>. It has started with funding being a </p></bod