            "id": "4964579",
            "title": "What Moved Markets This Week",
            "description": "<html><body><div class=\"wsb_wrapper\"> <div class=\"wsb_main\"><span><p data-eci=\"true\"><strong>Listen on the go! A daily podcast of Wall Street Breakfast will be available by 8:00 a.m. on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/author/wall-street-breakfast?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=toptext&amp;utm_campaign=wsbpodpromo\">Seeking Alpha</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">iTunes</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a>.</strong></p></span></div> <figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"\" data-id=\"1483074556\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"920\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1483074556/image_1483074556.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1483074556/image_1483074556.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1483074556/image_1483074556.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1483074556/image_1483074556.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1483074556/image_1483074556.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1483074556/image_1483074556.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1483074556/image_1483074556.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1483074556/image_1483074556.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1483074556/image_1483074556.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">franckreporter/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></picture></figure>\n<p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\"> </p> <p><span class=\"b\"><span class=\"italic\">Up for a challenge? Test your knowledge on the biggest events in the investing world over the past week. Take the latest <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/quiz/76-investment-news-quiz-friday-nov-6-2026-11-06#source=section%3Amain_content%7Cbutton%3Abody_link\">Seeking Alpha News Quiz</a> and see how you stack up against the competition.</span> </span></p> <h2> </h2> <p><br/>Wall Street’s major indexes went from cheerful optimism after the 2026 midterm elections to experiencing their worst day in over a year and a half. All three major indexes saw severe week-to-date losses from an ongoing technology selloff and policy fears related to AI.</p> <p>The Democratic Party gained a majority in both the House of Representatives and the Senate, and Congress is now expected to heavily limit <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4664929-nasdaq-rises-2-percent-after-democratic-sweep-of-congress\">the president’s agenda.</a></p> <p>Semiconductors and software were among the most problematic sectors, with giants such as Micron Technology (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MU\" title=\"Micron Technology, Inc.\">MU</a>), Dell Technologies (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DELL\" title=\"Dell Technologies Inc.\">DELL</a>), Lam Research (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/LRCX\" title=\"Lam Research Corporation\">LRCX</a>), Intel (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/INTC\" title=\"Intel Corporation\">INTC</a>), and Advanced Micro Devices (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AMD\" title=\"Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.\">AMD</a>) losing as much as 25% this week.</p> <p>Among top companies reporting this week were Apple (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AAPL\" title=\"Apple Inc.\">AAPL</a>), Palantir (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PLTR\" title=\"Palantir Technologies Inc.\">PLTR</a>), Advanced Micro Devices (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AMD\" title=\"Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.\">AMD</a>), Arm Holdings (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ARM\" title=\"Arm Holdings plc\">ARM</a>), and QUALCOMM (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/QCOM\" title=\"QUALCOMM Incorporated\">QCOM</a>).</p> <p>In addition, the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COMP:IND\" title=\"NASDAQ Composite Index\">COMP:IND</a>) entered correction territory on Thursday, and the Dow (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DJI\" title=\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Index\">DJI</a>) declined so much that day it erased all gains from the post-midterms rally. All three averages had their worst one-day losses since April 2025.</p> <p>On the economic calendar, October U.S. ISM Services growth ticked <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4664816-ism-services-growth-ticks-down-in-october-as-new-order-growth-slows\" target=\"_blank\">down</a> as new order growth slowed, and U.S. nonfarm payrolls <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4668087-nonfarm-payrolls-surge-in-october-sending-the-unemployment-rate-lower\" target=\"_blank\">jumped</a> by 165,000 in October, more than doubling what the markets expected.</p> <p>The probability of a 25-basis-point increase in interest rates during the FOMC’s December meeting is now 77.1%, according to the CME FedWatch Tool.</p> <p>Oil prices declined by a large margin this week. Crude oil futures (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CL1:COM#hasComeFromMpArticle=false%23source=section%3Amain_content%7Cbutton%3Abody_link%7Cfirst_level_url%3Anews\" target=\"_blank\">CL1:COM</a>) were 13.1% lower at $90.50, while Brent (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CO1:COM#hasComeFromMpArticle=false%23source=section%3Amain_content%7Cbutton%3Abody_link%7Cfirst_level_url%3Anews\" target=\"_blank\">CO1:COM</a>) was 13.7% lower at $97.94 per barrel.</p> <p>For the week, the S&amp;P (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) lost <span class=\"red\">-2.7%</span>, while the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COMP:IND\" title=\"NASDAQ Composite Index\">COMP:IND</a>) was <span class=\"red\">-3.4%</span> lower, and the blue-chip Dow (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DJI\" title=\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Index\">DJI</a>) dropped <span class=\"red\">-0.9%</span>. Read a preview of next week's major events in <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4667055-catalyst-watch-post-election-positioning-anthropic-ipo-buzz-and-adobe-event\" target=\"_blank\">Seeking Alpha's Catalyst Watch.</a><br/> </p> <h2><a class=\"!no-underline !text-share-text\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4668092-low-hire-low-fire-job-market-how-long-will-it-last\">Jobs trends</a></h2> <p>The U.S. economy has seen strong growth and low unemployment for the last three years, but there's one worrying trend that has persisted – hiring is still fairly muted. According to the JOLTS report released this week, the number of job openings was little changed in September. But October's nonfarm payrolls data showed that hiring picked up. How long will the \"low-hire, low-fire job market\" last? <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4668092-low-hire-low-fire-job-market-how-long-will-it-last\"><span class=\"b\">Read more.</span></a></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Seeking Alpha's Calls Of The Week</p> <p>VICI Properties (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/VICI\" title=\"VICI Properties Inc.\">VICI</a>): $2B Says Mr. Market <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4961307-vici-properties-stock-2-billion-says-mr-market-may-be-wrong\">May Be Wrong</a>.<br/><br/>Sandisk (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SNDK\" title=\"Sandisk Corporation\">SNDK</a>) Declines, But RPO Tells <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4963211-sandisk-a-35-percent-stock-decline-but-rpo-tells-a-different-story-upgrade\">A Different Story</a>.<br/><br/>Cal-Maine Foods (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CALM\" title=\"Cal-Maine Foods, Inc.\">CALM</a>): Looking Past <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4961438-cal-maine-foods-looking-past-the-egg-price-collapse-upgrade\">Egg Price Collapse</a>.<br/><br/>This Is <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4962150-why-im-not-worried-about-amd-anymore-rating-upgrade\">Why I'm Not Worried</a> About AMD (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AMD\" title=\"Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.\">AMD</a>) Anymore.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SOR\" title=\"Source Capital\">SOR</a>: Boring Is Beautiful - Time To <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4961895-sor-boring-is-beautiful-why-its-time-to-go-long-this-cef-rating-upgrade\">Go Long On This CEF</a>.<br/><br/>Alphabet (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GOOG\" title=\"Alphabet Inc.\">GOOG</a>): One Quarter Was Noise, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4961511-alphabet-one-quarter-was-noise-two-is-a-trend-rating-downgrade\">Two Is A Trend</a>.<br/><br/>Bloom Energy (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BE\" title=\"Bloom Energy Corporation\">BE</a>) Is A Hold As Negativity <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4962255-bloom-energy-downgrading-to-hold-as-the-negativity-grows-louder\">Grows Louder</a>.<br/><br/>Sell Intel (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/INTC\" title=\"Intel Corporation\">INTC</a>) - The Smart Money <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4961062-intel-the-smart-money-is-now-underwater-rating-downgrade\">Is Now Underwater</a>.<br/><br/>Don't Get Excited About Microsoft’s (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MSFT\" title=\"Microsoft Corporation\">MSFT</a>) <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4962387-microsoft-dont-get-too-excited-about-its-positive-fcf-rating-downgrade\">Positive FCF</a>.<br/><br/>Baidu (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BIDU\" title=\"Baidu, Inc.\">BIDU</a>) Q3 Preview: Growing <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4962063-baidu-q3-2026-preview-growing-disintermediation-risk-downgrade-to-sell\">Disintermediation Risk</a>.</p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Weekly Movement</p> <p><span><strong>U.S. Indices</strong><br/>Dow <span class=\"red\">-0.9%</span> to 51,286. S&amp;P 500 <span class=\"red\">-2.7%</span> to 7,377. Nasdaq <span class=\"red\">-3.4%</span> to 24,579. Russell 2000 <span class=\"red\">-2.1%</span> to 2,754. CBOE Volatility Index <span class=\"green\">+32%</span> to 25.64. <br/><br/><strong>S&amp;P 500 Sectors</strong><br/>Consumer Staples <span class=\"green\">+1%</span>. Utilities <span class=\"red\">-0.7%</span>. Financials <span class=\"green\">+1.1%</span>. Telecom <span class=\"green\">+2.3%</span>. Healthcare <span class=\"red\">-0.1%</span>. Industrials <span class=\"red\">-2.8%</span>. Information Technology <span class=\"red\">-6.9%</span>. Materials <span class=\"red\">-0.4%</span>. Energy <span class=\"red\">-11.9%</span>. Consumer Discretionary <span class=\"green\">+2.7%</span>. Real Estate <span class=\"green\">+1.8%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>World Indices</strong><br/>London <span class=\"red\">-0.5%</span> to 10,674. France <span class=\"green\">+2.1%</span> to 8,139. Germany flat at 25,820. Japan <span class=\"red\">-9.3%</span> to 57,435. China <span class=\"green\">+1.4%</span> to 3,649. Hong Kong <span class=\"green\">+5.1%</span> to 24,482. India <span class=\"green\">+8.8%</span> to 81,028. <br/><br/><strong>Commodities and Bonds</strong><br/>Crude Oil WTI <span class=\"red\">-13.2%</span> to $90.34/bbl. Gold <span class=\"green\">+4.6%</span> to $4,079.5/oz. Natural Gas <span class=\"green\">+3.6%</span> to 3.003. Ten-Year Bond Yield -0.2 bps to 4.859. <br/><br/><strong>Forex and Cryptos</strong><br/>EUR/USD <span class=\"red\">-0.18%</span>. USD/JPY <span class=\"green\">+0.6%</span>. GBP/USD <span class=\"red\">-0.3%</span>. Bitcoin <span class=\"red\">-2%</span>. Litecoin <span class=\"red\">-5.9%</span>. Ethereum <span class=\"red\">-0.4%</span>. XRP <span class=\"red\">-6.9%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Gainers</strong><br/>AppLovin (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/APP\" title=\"AppLovin Corporation\">APP</a>) <span class=\"green\">+71%</span>. Fiserv (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FISV\" title=\"Fiserv, Inc.\">FISV</a>) <span class=\"green\">+26%</span>. IDEXX Laboratories (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/IDXX\" title=\"IDEXX Laboratories, Inc.\">IDXX</a>) <span class=\"green\">+23%</span>. The Mosaic (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MOS\" title=\"The Mosaic Company\">MOS</a>) <span class=\"green\">+22%</span>. Airbnb (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ABNB\" title=\"Airbnb, Inc.\">ABNB</a>) <span class=\"green\">+16%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Losers</strong><br/>Lumentum Holdings (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/LITE\" title=\"Lumentum Holdings Inc.\">LITE</a>) <span class=\"red\">-36%</span>. Seagate Technology Holdings (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/STX\" title=\"Seagate Technology Holdings plc\">STX</a>) <span class=\"red\">-28%</span>. Marvell Technology (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MRVL\" title=\"Marvell Technology, Inc.\">MRVL</a>) <span class=\"red\">-28%</span>. Western Digital (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WDC\" title=\"Western Digital Corporation\">WDC</a>) <span class=\"red\">-28%</span>. Sandisk (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SNDK\" title=\"Sandisk Corporation\">SNDK</a>) <span class=\"red\">-27%</span>. <br/><br/><i>Where will the markets be headed next week? Current trends and ideas? Add your thoughts to the comments section.</i></span></p> </div></body></html>",
